      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VINTAGE FLAIR (6) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4 lengths from the winner (19.99). Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Rates on top in this line up. LAVENDER LANE (1) produced a moderate effort last time when eighth at this track over 530m behind Zinfandel Star (31.56) in a Special conditions race. The form from her last run stacks up well. Worth another chance. SPRINGVALE MARGI (2) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 342m behind Aurora Borealis (20.23) in a TG1-4W. Placed at her previous run. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. REGAL STANCE (8) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
